In right triangle ABC, given that angle C is 90 degrees, D is a point on the side of AC, and AB is 10 units long, AC is 8 units long, if triangle ABC is similar to triangle BDC, what is the length of CD?
Options:
A. 4.0
B. \frac{3}{2}
C. \frac{4}{3}
D. \frac{9}{4}
